  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian assistance for displaced and conflict-affected communities along the Thailand-Myanmar border</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Humanitarian assistance for displaced and conflict-affected communities along the Thailand-Myanmar border  is a component of Burma Humanitarian Assistance and Resilience Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;5,400,000. It works in the following sector(s): Food assistance, Facilitation of orderly, safe, regular and responsible migration and mobility, Relief co-ordination and support services, Emergency food assistance, Reproductive health care.</narrative>
  </description>
